function showLoginForm(){if(!backendConfigured){toast(t('backendMissing'));return}if(!supabaseClient){toast(t('cloudError'));return}$('#modalTitle').textContent=t('adminLogin');$('#modalBody').innerHTML=`<form id="adminLoginForm"><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-field full"><label>${t('email')}</label><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" required></div><div class="form-field full"><label>${t('password')}</label><input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></div></div><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-close>${t('cancel')}</button><button class="btn btn-primary">${t('login')}</button></div></form>`;showModal();$('#adminLoginForm').onsubmit=async ev=>{ev.preventDefault();let fd=new FormData(ev.currentTarget);const {error}=await supabaseClient.auth.signInWithPassword({email:String(fd.get('email')).trim(),password:String(fd.get('password'))});if(error){toast(t('loginFailed'));return}if(!await checkAdminSession()){toast(t('notAdmin'));closeModal();return}await loadSharedContent();if(coordinator)await ensureCoordinatorContent();await startContentRealtime();if(admin){await loadAdminData();await startAdminRealtime()}closeModal();toast(t('loginSuccess'));render()}}
async function roleAction(){if(!backendConfigured){admin=!admin;toast(admin?t('checkRole'):t('studentMode'));if(view==='dashboard'&&!admin)go('home');else render();return}if(!supabaseClient){toast(t('cloudError'));return}if(admin||coordinator){await supabaseClient.auth.signOut();if(cloudChannel)await supabaseClient.removeChannel(cloudChannel);cloudChannel=null;if(contentChannel)await supabaseClient.removeChannel(contentChannel);contentChannel=null;admin=false;coordinator=false;managedClubIds=[];cloudUser=null;render();toast(t('logout'));return}showLoginForm()}
async function initBackend(){if(!backendConfigured)return;if(!window.supabase?.createClient){toast(t('cloudError'));return}try{supabaseClient=window.supabase.createClient(BACKEND_CFG.url,BACKEND_CFG.publishableKey,{auth:{persistSession:true,autoRefreshToken:true,detectSessionInUrl:false}});let sharedReady=await loadSharedContent();await startContentRealtime();const ok=await checkAdminSession();if(ok){if(coordinator){await ensureCoordinatorContent();sharedReady=await loadSharedContent()}if(admin){await loadAdminData();await startAdminRealtime()}$('#roleBtn').textContent=admin?'A':'C';$('#roleBtn').title=t('logout');if(['dashboard','tracking'].includes(view))render()}else{$('#roleBtn').textContent='م';$('#roleBtn').title=t('adminLogin')}$('#roleBtn').classList.add('cloud-mode');sharedOnline=sharedReady;const sync=$('.sync-state span');if(sync)sync.textContent=sharedReady?t('onlineMode'):t('sharedContentError');const dot=$('.sync-state i');if(dot)dot.classList.toggle('connected',sharedReady);if(!sharedReady)toast(t('sharedContentError'))}catch(err){sharedOnline=false;console.error(err);toast(t('cloudError'))}}
